<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= activity.title %> - Guia de Acesso Pedagógico | Lab Kids</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Acesse <%= activity.title %> no Portal Lab Kids. Atividade educativa recomendada para estudantes, alinhada à BNCC e com foco no desenvolvimento de raciocínio lógico.">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css?v=6">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;600;700&family=Outfit:wght@400;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- Google AdSense Verification Script -->
    <script async src="https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=<%= adsensePubId %>" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <style>
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e1b4b 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 30px 15px;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .guide-card {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.95);
            border: 2px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4);
            border-radius: 28px;
            max-width: 780px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .activity-icon-lg {
            width: 96px;
            height: 96px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border: 4px solid #fbbf24;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .activity-title {
            font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.4rem);
            color: #fbbf24;
            margin: 10px 0;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .activity-desc {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin: 0 auto 25px auto;
        }

        .pedagogical-summary {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.7);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .summary-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .summary-item {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6);
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }

        .summary-item strong {
            color: #38bdf8;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .btn-launch-direct {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
            color: white;
            padding: 18px 45px;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.4);
            border: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
            transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s;
        }

        .btn-launch-direct:hover {
            transform: scale(1.04);
            box-shadow: 0 14px 35px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.6);
        }

        .safety-note {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            margin-top: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .back-link {
            color: #94a3b8;
            text-decoration: underline;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-top: 20px;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .back-link:hover { color: #ffffff; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="guide-card">
        <img src="<%= activity.icon_url || 'https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/616/616430.png' %>" class="activity-icon-lg" alt="<%= activity.title %>">
        
        <h1 class="activity-title"><%= activity.title %></h1>
        <p class="activity-desc"><%= activity.description || 'Desafio interativo pedagógico selecionado pela coordenação do Lab Kids para enriquecer a experiência de aprendizagem dos estudantes da rede municipal.' %></p>

        <div class="pedagogical-summary">
            <h3 style="margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #38bdf8; font-size: 1.15rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <span>📘</span> Enquadramento Pedagógico e Segurança Digital
            </h3>
            <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.95rem; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.5;">
                Esta ferramenta foi avaliada sob critérios de adequação à faixa etária, valor educativo no desenvolvimento de raciocínio lógico e conformidade com as diretrizes curriculares da BNCC.
            </p>
            <div class="summary-grid">
                <div class="summary-item">
                    <strong>Disciplina / Foco</strong>
                    <%= activity.subject || 'Raciocínio Lógico & Cultura Digital' %>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-item">
                    <strong>Público Recomendado</strong>
                    <%= activity.level ? activity.level + 'º Ano do Ensino Fundamental' : 'Educação Básica' %>
                </div>
                <div class="summary-item">
                    <strong>Habilidade BNCC</strong>
                    <%= activity.bncc_code || 'Competência Geral 5 (Cultura Digital)' %>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <a href="<%= activity.activity_url %>" class="btn-launch-direct" target="<%= isExternal ? '_blank' : '_self' %>" rel="noopener">
            🎮 INICIAR ATIVIDADE AGORA 🚀
        </a>

        <div class="safety-note">
            <span>🛡️</span> Ambiente educacional seguro. Não coletamos dados pessoais de estudantes menores de idade.
        </div>

        <div>
            <a href="/" class="back-link">⬅️ Voltar à lista de atividades do Portal</a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
